{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656288",
      "title": "Styling Active Router Links",
      "lectureOrder": 454,
      "videoOrder": 416,
      "sourceHash": "9918c31100aa1408826609d4a5bed9ba0b9031da1edb82375a8f2937a468fc67",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.49,
          "end": 5.19,
          "en": "-: We of course added navigation to our page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.19,
          "end": 9,
          "en": "But one issue is that whilst the does work fine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 11.25,
          "en": "we get no visual indication",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.25,
          "end": 14.28,
          "en": "of what the currently active route is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.28,
          "end": 17.49,
          "en": "It would be nice if the selected tab would change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.49,
          "end": 20.79,
          "en": "and that of course is only a CSS thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.79,
          "end": 23.22,
          "en": "because if you check your app component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "you'll see we got this active class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 26.67,
          "en": "on the list item which determines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 29.133,
          "en": "whether this is marked as active, if that's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.133,
          "end": 32.573,
          "en": "if this link gets the right CSS classes or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.573,
          "end": 34.11,
          "en": "So it would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.11,
          "end": 37.8,
          "en": "if we could dynamically set this class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.8,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "I will remove it from here and how,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 42.72,
          "en": "how can we now set it dynamically?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.72,
          "end": 46.47,
          "en": "Angular gives us a specific directive for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.47,
          "end": 51.47,
          "en": "The Router Link Active Directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "And the convenient thing about this directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.52,
          "end": 57.36,
          "en": "is you can add it to a wrapping element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.36,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "like we do here to the list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 63.27,
          "en": "or also of course, to the link itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 66.24,
          "en": "and it will attach the class you specify",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "in between here, for example, active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 70.23,
          "en": "So this should be a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.23,
          "end": 72.36,
          "en": "to that element it sits on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.36,
          "end": 74.82,
          "en": "Now active on the link itself wouldn't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.82,
          "end": 76.74,
          "en": "do anything when using Bootstrap.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.74,
          "end": 78.51,
          "en": "Here for this tabs look,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.51,
          "end": 80.28,
          "en": "we need to add it to the list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.28,
          "end": 81.39,
          "en": "but this of course depends",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.39,
          "end": 84.51,
          "en": "on which package or which CSS code you are using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.51,
          "end": 87.3,
          "en": "And here you could specify any class you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.3,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "like my active class or whatever that is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 93.63,
          "en": "So here it is active to make it look nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.63,
          "end": 95.1,
          "en": "in Bootstraps world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 98.61,
          "en": "and I will add it to all my links here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 102.15,
          "en": "So now theoretically all my links should receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "this active CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 108.3,
          "en": "once they are clicked or when they are active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "So if we have a look at this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 112.56,
          "en": "it seems to work because we still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 114.87,
          "en": "have homes set as our active page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.87,
          "end": 117.09,
          "en": "even though we remove this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.09,
          "end": 119.043,
          "en": "this active class we had there before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.043,
          "end": 121.68,
          "en": "if I click servers it gets marked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.68,
          "end": 123.99,
          "en": "as active too and the same for users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 123.99,
          "end": 125.61,
          "en": "So this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.61,
          "end": 129.96,
          "en": "But somehow home is always marked as active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.96,
          "end": 132.69,
          "en": "So that does not seem to work correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.69,
          "end": 133.953,
          "en": "What's wrong here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.42,
          "end": 138,
          "en": "Well, the router link active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 140.01,
          "en": "directive does one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 140.01,
          "end": 142.8,
          "en": "It analyzes your currently loaded path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 142.8,
          "end": 144.84,
          "en": "and then checks which links lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.84,
          "end": 147.27,
          "en": "to a route which uses this path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.27,
          "end": 151.02,
          "en": "And by default it marks an element as active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.02,
          "end": 153.149,
          "en": "It adds this CSS class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 153.149,
          "end": 156.81,
          "en": "if it contains the path you are on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 159.99,
          "en": "or if this link is part of the path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.99,
          "end": 161.64,
          "en": "which is currently loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.64,
          "end": 164.4,
          "en": "So for the slash service link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 166.44,
          "en": "or the slash users link, this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 166.44,
          "end": 169.62,
          "en": "of course the case once we click servers or users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 169.62,
          "end": 171.48,
          "en": "For the slash nothing link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 171.48,
          "end": 173.57999999999998,
          "en": "which is the first one, the homepage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 173.57999999999998,
          "end": 175.41,
          "en": "This is always the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 175.41,
          "end": 177.48,
          "en": "We always have slash nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.48,
          "end": 179.55,
          "en": "at the beginning of our path here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 179.55,
          "end": 182.04,
          "en": "So if we are on slash users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 182.04,
          "end": 184.56,
          "en": "well there is this empty path in between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 184.56,
          "end": 186.48,
          "en": "you could say, the same for servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 186.48,
          "end": 189.15,
          "en": "and the same for just home of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 189.15,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "So the empty path segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 193.95,
          "en": "is part of all paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 193.95,
          "end": 197.1,
          "en": "Still we don't want to have home being marked as",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 197.1,
          "end": 199.05,
          "en": "active all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 199.05,
          "end": 202.17000000000002,
          "en": "So to fix this we can add some configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 202.17000000000002,
          "end": 204.42000000000002,
          "en": "to this Router Link Active Directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 204.42000000000002,
          "end": 206.01,
          "en": "And I will just split this up all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 206.01,
          "end": 207.12,
          "en": "over multiple lines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 207.12,
          "end": 209.853,
          "en": "to make this a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 210.72,
          "end": 213.27,
          "en": "So we can add a special configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 215.82,
          "en": "to our Router Link Active Directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 215.82,
          "end": 218.61,
          "en": "So on the same element as Router Link Active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 218.61,
          "end": 220.47,
          "en": "was added to we can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 220.47,
          "end": 224.79,
          "en": "router link active options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 224.79,
          "end": 227.31,
          "en": "And this now needs some property binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 227.31,
          "end": 230.25,
          "en": "because we don't just pass a string there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 230.25,
          "end": 232.59,
          "en": "Instead we pass a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 232.59,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "and that would not work without",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 234.06,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "having our square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 238.92000000000002,
          "en": "So with square brackets we can pass anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 238.92000000000002,
          "end": 240.81,
          "en": "which will be resolved dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 240.81,
          "end": 242.61,
          "en": "like this JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 242.61,
          "end": 244.83,
          "en": "And here we can basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 244.83,
          "end": 246.87,
          "en": "add one important configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 248.343,
          "en": "say exact,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 250.23,
          "end": 251.58,
          "en": "and set this to True.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 251.58,
          "end": 254.73,
          "en": "So Exact is a kind of a reserved property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 254.73,
          "end": 256.2,
          "en": "On this object you pass to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 256.2,
          "end": 257.97,
          "en": "Router Link Active options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 257.97,
          "end": 261.27,
          "en": "and this will now basically tell Angular, only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 261.27,
          "end": 263.67,
          "en": "at this Router Link Active class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 266.49,
          "en": "So does active CSS class in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 266.49,
          "end": 269.34,
          "en": "If the exact the full path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 269.34,
          "end": 272.73,
          "en": "is well whatever this link leads to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 272.73,
          "end": 275.08,
          "en": "So only if everything is just slash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 275.998,
          "end": 277.56,
          "en": "and not if it is only part of the path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 277.56,
          "end": 279.09000000000003,
          "en": "So if this in place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 279.09000000000003,
          "end": 280.62,
          "en": "now you see it still is marked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 280.62,
          "end": 283.95,
          "en": "as active on the empty path at the starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 283.95,
          "end": 285.72,
          "en": "But if you go to slash servers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 285.72,
          "end": 288.57,
          "en": "now only servers is marked as active because now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 288.57,
          "end": 292.11,
          "en": "we fixed this, we changed the default behavior to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 292.11,
          "end": 294.48,
          "en": "make sure we only mark this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 294.48,
          "end": 296.7,
          "en": "if the full path is well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 296.7,
          "end": 299.313,
          "en": "whatever we have on our router link.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
